[7.435002, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n│ 1. BOUNDARY INTEGRITY: Suffix Trie achieved 0 FP errors across all scales. Aho-Corasick failed 3/3 boundary tests │\r\n│    because raw string transitions cannot discern dot boundaries ('notdomain.com' matches 'domain.com').          │\r\n│ 2. REBUILD LATENCY: Suffix Trie builds in ~28 ms at 100k rules; Aho-Corasick takes ~130 ms (4.6x slower) due to  │\r\n│    BFS failure-link graph traversal, creating noticeable latency spikes during atomic control-plane updates.      │\r\n│ 3. MEMORY SCALING: Aho-Corasick exhibits massive state expansion (>180 MB at 100k) due to transition fan-out,    │\r\n│    whereas Suffix Trie consumes only ~3.8 MB (47x lower memory footprint).                                        │\r\n│ 4. SCALE INVARIANCE: Suffix Trie lookup latency remai"]
[7.435046, "o", "ns flat at ~160-180 ns (O(L) depth) regardless of rule scale.│\r\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n\r\n╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║                 FRAME 2: GENERATION-TAGGED LRU CACHE ENGINE PERFORMANCE EVALUATION                                 ║\r\n║           Benchmarking Monotonic Expiration, Splicing O(1) Eviction, and Generation Stamp Checking                ║\r\n╚"]
